            "review_title": "Review at Cork & Fork - Wine and Kitchen",
            "review_text": "snutkins\n148 contributions\n0\nFantastic wine and charcuterie\nJan 2019 • Couples\nWe popped into here because we wanted to get a nice glass of wine and stayed for food too as it's such a nice, comfortable place to relax for an evening.\n\nThere is a great choice of wines from around the world and the wine list is put together from customer tasting nights so theres something for everyone.\n\nThe food is great, we had some freshly cooked crepes which were delicious and mixed charcuterie plate which really hit the spot as we were missing cheese during our travels! \n\nGreat little place in a nice location - it's bustling little side street but set back from the pandemonium of HCMC main roads.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2019",
