            "review_title": "Review at Cork & Fork - Wine and Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Steve R\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n1\nGimme Shelter!\nNov 2018 • Friends\nGot caught in a Storm Sunday evening and stumbled into Cork & Fork. The owner Batiste welcomed us in and took care of us while we waited for it to pass. He was friendly and knowledgeable about the area if you have any questions while you are visiting Saigon. He even sat with us and played cards.\n\nGreat wine and cheese selection as well! Make sure to stop in here on your next visit to Saigon.\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2018",
