            "review_text": "Jackie S\nChattanooga, Tennessee4 contributions\n0\nA gem\nNov 2018 • Friends\nThe ambiance is very nice! Great spot for friends, couples or families. They have a great selection of wine and drinks!! Not a lot of restaurants served good wine in the area so this was a treat. The cheese platter was Delicious!!! So are the crepes! The music was also fun to listen too and was at just the right volume. My friend and I really enjoyed our night and only wish we found the place sooner. Highly recommend!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2018",
