            "review_text": "Dylan G\n10 contributions\n0\nStylish little cafe/bar\nOct 2018 • Couples\nSmall little bar type cafe nestled in amongst the busy streets. We were served by a lovely young man who could not do enough for us. His English wasn’t the best but he tried so hard to do anything he could for us! The drinks came out in an instant however the food took quite a long time to be prepared only for us to find out that he was in training and it was his first cheese platter he had ever prepared. The lady behind the counter seemed very disinterested and not helpful towards the young man at all as he was taking orders, serving and preparing the dishes. The food wasn’t the best however his service greatly made up for that!\nRead more\nWritten October 22, 2018\nCork & Fork -Wine bar and Kitchen\nThank you very much for your comment Dylan, it is greatly appreciated! We are glad you enjoyed our waiter’s service 🙂\nWritten October 22, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
